[[Dolyak Master]]s are [[Stone Summit]] who ride the great horned [[Dolyak]]s that roam the [[Shiverpeak Mountains]].  Despite their fearsome appearance, the Dolyak Masters primarily fill a support role, providing [[Healing Prayers|healing]] and magical [[Protection Prayers|protection]] to fellow Stone Summit.  The protection provided by the Dolyak Masters is particularly insidious, causing the target to be healed whenever it would normally take damage.

