==Notes==
* In Prophecies, it can be helpful to attack another foe first until it receives [[Mark of Protection]], then focus on the Dolyak Master.
* When in groups of two or more, Dolyak Masters can be particularly challenging to take out, especially in hard mode. Consider bringing [[interrupt]]s, enchantment removing skills, or anti-healing skills like [[Scourge Healing]] and [[Scourge Enchantment]] to deal with them.
